<edge id="R:e14fb1b98d" source="paper-A:Measurement:magnetic-ac-qmax-for-lactic-acid-74-6-mg" target="paper-A:Conclusion:adsorption-governed-by-surface-chemistry"><data key="e_predicate">SUPPORTS</data><data key="e_source_id">paper-A</data><data key="e_strength">direct</data><data key="e_conditions">{}</data><data key="e_paragraph_id">p-0040</data><data key="e_quote">which directly underscores that surface area is not the primary determinant of efficiency in these systems</data></edge>
